How the reference pictures align with the target video — Picture 1 (from Shot 1) aligns with the 0.00-second mark of the target video.

integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Continuous tight close-up of the old scientist's face, lit by green panel light. The camera stays still. Start exactly at Picture 1. For the first three and a half seconds he speaks a short sentence in Japanese in a weak, rasping whisper, his lips moving slowly, a faint knowing smile at the end. Then he lets out a long last breath, his eyes slowly close, and his head sinks gently to one side and stays still. No blood, no wound visible. No text appears. Keep the dark blue-green color grade.

overall_soundscape: His weak rasping whisper, a long last exhale, then only the low hum of machinery.

non_diegetic_music: N/A
